• Always includes: "Try this..." directive for next attempt

1.3.2 Retrieval Practice Integration
• Unprompted recall questions every 4-6 exchanges
• Spaced repetition markers ("Come back to this in 3 sessions")
• Interleaved practice (mixes related concepts to prevent chunking)
• Elaboration prompts ("How does this connect to yesterday's concept?")

1.3.3 Metacognitive Development
